review_comments_data.body:
@lebaphi - could we please generate the diff using an JSON-Patch library?  Then we can be confident of how the diff is written/implemented. This also means apps other than Serge may be able to handle/generate them.
The possible libraries are here:
https://jsonpatch.com/#javascript

